# NetLab lab node SSH server. Lab only: root may log in with a password.
# The port is published on 127.0.0.1 only (see the lab topology), so it is
# not reachable from your LAN unless you change that on purpose.
Port 22
PermitRootLogin yes
PasswordAuthentication yes
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
UseDNS no
PrintMotd no
Subsystem sftp internal-sftp
